const isTransientDatabaseError=error=>['ECONNRESET','ECONNREFUSED','ETIMEDOUT','ECONNABORTED','57P01','57P03','08003','08006','53300'].includes(error.code)||/connection terminated unexpectedly|socket hang up|timeout/i.test(error.message||'');
if(process.env.RUN_STARTUP_MIGRATIONS==='true'){
for(let attempt=0;attempt<3;attempt++){
 try{await pool.query('ALTER TABLE coupons DROP CONSTRAINT IF EXISTS coupons_discount_percent_check');await pool.query('ALTER TABLE coupons ADD CONSTRAINT coupons_discount_percent_check CHECK (discount_percent >= 1)');await pool.query('ALTER TABLE orders ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS idempotency_key text');await pool.query('CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS orders_idempotency_key_unique ON orders(idempotency_key) WHERE idempotency_key IS NOT NULL');await pool.query('ALTER TABLE customers ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS auth_user_id uuid');await pool.query('CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS customers_auth_user_id_unique ON customers(auth_user_id) WHERE auth_user_id IS NOT NULL');await pool.query(`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS customer_addresses (id uuid PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),auth_user_id uuid NOT NULL,label text NOT NULL DEFAULT 'Home',recipient_name text NOT NULL,phone text NOT NULL,line1 text NOT NULL,line2 text NOT NULL DEFAULT '',city text NOT NULL,state text NOT NULL,pincode text NOT NULL,created_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),updated_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now())`);await pool.query('CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS customer_addresses_user_created ON customer_addresses(auth_user_id,created_at DESC)');break;}
 catch(error){if(!isTransientDatabaseError(error)||attempt===2){console.error('Coupon schema migration could not complete:',error.message);break;}await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,500*(attempt+1)));}
}
try{await pool.query('ALTER TABLE customer_addresses ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS is_default boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT false');await pool.query('CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS customer_addresses_one_default_per_user ON customer_addresses(auth_user_id) WHERE is_default=true');await pool.query('ALTER TABLE orders ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS delivered_at timestamptz');await pool.query("UPDATE orders SET delivered_at=updated_at WHERE status='delivered' AND delivered_at IS NULL");await pool.query(`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS customer_wishlists(auth_user_id uuid NOT NULL,product_id uuid NOT NULL REFERENCES products(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,created_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),PRIMARY KEY(auth_user_id,product_id))`);await pool.query(`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS customer_order_requests(id uuid PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),order_id uuid NOT NULL REFERENCES orders(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,order_item_id uuid REFERENCES order_items(id) ON DELETE CASCADE,request_type text NOT NULL CHECK(request_type IN ('cancellation','return','exchange')),reason text NOT NULL,comments text NOT NULL DEFAULT '',status text NOT NULL DEFAULT 'requested' CHECK(status IN ('requested','under_review','approved','rejected','pickup_arranged','received','refund_processing','completed')),decision_reason text NOT NULL DEFAULT '',requested_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),updated_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now())`);await pool.query("CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS customer_order_requests_active_unique ON customer_order_requests(order_id,COALESCE(order_item_id,'00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000'::uuid),request_type) WHERE status IN ('requested','under_review','approved','pickup_arranged','received','refund_processing')");await pool.query('CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS customer_order_requests_order_date ON customer_order_requests(order_id,requested_at DESC)');}catch(error){console.error('Customer account migration could not complete:',error.message);}
try{await pool.query(`CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS customer_notifications(id uuid PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid(),auth_user_id uuid NOT NULL,title text NOT NULL,body text NOT NULL,order_id uuid REFERENCES orders(id) ON DELETE SET NULL,created_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),read_at timestamptz)`);await pool.query('CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS customer_notifications_user_created ON customer_notifications(auth_user_id,created_at DESC)');}catch(error){console.error('Customer notifications migration could not complete:',error.message);}
try{await pool.query("ALTER TABLE collections ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS destination_url text NOT NULL DEFAULT ''");}catch(error){console.error('Collection destination migration could not complete:',error.message);}
}
